  "worked_solution": "The similarity ratio is the ratio of the corresponding sides.\n\nSince $△DEF∼△PQR,$ the side $\\overset{―}{DE}$ corresponds to the side $\\overset{―}{PQ}$\n\nTherefore, the similarity ratio is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}k & =\\frac{PQ}{DE} \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{9} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
